  "body": "I can't find `toString` in http://heycam.github.io/webidl/#es-DOMException-prototype-object but it's supported by Blink, Gecko and WebKit as `this.name + \": \" + this.message`. IE11 appears to stringify as either the name or the message, I can't tell because they're the case I tested.\n",
